ds have different levels of candy cravings. You want to be fair, so you give more candies to the friend who loves them the most. Weighted Round Robin does something similar – it gives more tasks to the friends who can handle them better.Three servers are assigned weights: Server1 (0.3), Server2 (0.2), and Server3 (0.1).The total weight is 0.6 (0.3 + 0.2 + 0.1).Server1 receives 50% of the requests (0.3 / 0.6).Server2 receives 33.33% of the requests (0.2 / 0.6).Server3 receives 16.67% of the requests (0.1 / 0.6).Weighted Round RobinImplementing the Weighted Round Robin Load Balancing AlgorithmIt allows requests to be distributed across servers based on assigned weights, ensuring more capable servers handle a higher share of the traffic.
